
[BROKE] Keyboard focus is trapped: Card number - /checkout/
  source: #card-element > div:nth-of-type(1)
  wcag: 2.1.2; EN 301 549 9.2.1.2
  path: #billing_email then #billing_phone then #card-element > div:nth-of-type(1) (4 times)
  Tab and Shift+Tab kept focus here for 4 presses; 3 focusable elements after it can't be reached.
  fix: Let Tab move on from the field.
  rhythm soundcheck accept be183701 if this is expected
[NEW] Form elements must have labels - /checkout/
  source: #card_cvc
  wcag: 1.3.1, 4.1.2; EN 301 549 9.1.3.1, 9.4.1.2
  <input id="card_cvc" name="card_cvc">
  fix: See https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/label for what the rule asks and how to fix it.
  rhythm soundcheck accept 4beb5ae4 if this is expected
